{"mls":"R1700513","addr":"1407 Washington Street","muni":"Olean city","town":"Olean","county":"Cattaraugus","zip":"14760","ll":[42.079684,-78.446749],"status":"Active","type":"Single Family","units":1,"beds":2,"baths":2,"sqft":1281.0,"year":1940,"lot":0.087,"dom":56,"price":139900,"orig":null,"chg":"New Listing","tax":3101,"tax_mls":true,"hoa":null,"office":"Howard Hanna Professionals - Olean","phone":"716-378-7039","hhp":true,"remarks":"Pride of ownership shines throughout this vinyl-sided West Olean gem. The big-ticket items are already handled: the roof is approximately 10 years old, and the boiler is only 3 years old, so you can move in with peace of mind. Step inside to a surprisingly spacious first floor featuring a formal dining room, comfortable living room, eat-in kitchen, and a convenient half bath. The heated sunroom is a real bonus, a bright, year-round spot for morning coffee, a home office, or curling up with a book no matter the season. Out back, you'll find a cute, private yard that's fully fenced and ready for the dog to run. The covered deck extends your living space outdoors, perfect for grilling or relaxing rain or shine. The former garage currently serves as great storage but offers real potential to be converted back — plus there's a concrete driveway for easy parking. Location seals the deal: just a block from Washington West Elementary and within walking distance of West State Street shops and restaurants. Homes this well cared for in this neighborhood don't last. This is a good one; schedule your showing today!","facts":[["Total rooms","6"],["Full baths","1"],["Half baths","1"],["Style","Historic Antique, Two Story"],["Levels","Two"],["Stories","2"],["Building area (sq ft)","1,281"],["Heating","Gas, Baseboard"],["Basement","Crawl Space, Partial"],["Foundation","Block"],["Construction","Vinyl Siding, Copper Plumbing"],["Garage","Yes"],["Garage spaces","1"],["Parking","Detached, Garage"],["Utilities","Cable Available, High Speed Internet Avail